# pedalboard — the boot rig autoplaying itself while the chain gets built:
# open the PEDALS palette, then kick the stompboxes in one at a time so the tone
# opens up pedal by pedal. Autoplay walks its own 8-chord progression at bpm 100
# (a chord every 4 beats), so the guitar keeps strumming with no input.
# Deterministic: no rnd(), no save state.
# frames 780
# fps 30
# crf 20
click 60 32 8
drag 110 245 128 175 288 45
click 230 32 8
down 260 1
up 264 1
down 380 2
up 384 2
down 500 5
up 504 5
down 620 3
up 624 3
